OL,3,AReform proposes #30 tax rebate for HMRC
OL,4,Aphone delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople on hold to HM Revenue and
OL,7,FCustoms (HMRC) for more than 30 minutes
OL,8,Fwould get #30 off their tax bill under
OL,9,Fa Reform UK government, Robert Jenrick
OL,10,Fhas announced.
OL,12,FReform's economy spokesman said HMRC's
OL,13,Ftreatment of taxpayers was "offensive
OL,14,Fto working people" and his party would
OL,15,Ftie the pay of senior HMRC officials to
OL,16,Fcustomer service targets.
OL,18,FTo prevent abuse, the tax credit for
OL,19,Fphone delays would be limited to two
OL,20,Foccasions in a given tax year, Jenrick
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
